research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/canonical-followup-before/research__advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-batch-51.notes.md:68:Owner-side readiness repair is required for the stale ADHM definition and escalated ADHM theorem chain, and the batch-50 owner must record the current S4 postulate readiness. Once those current records exist, recheck the exact supplier interfaces and update the batch-51 escalated records through the normal Step 1 workflow. The S3 inventory and unrelated level mismatches block the two run-wide mechanical checks and belong to their owners.
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/canonical-normalization-repair.md:46:50 and51 now use the independently proved `lem-qftx-stable-adhm-partition-fixed-points-and-tangent-character`, rather than the unnecessarily broad old ADHM/sheaf/ASD theorem. The full old theorem/GAGA scope is untouched. For each stable quotient X_k, the core supplies smoothness, separated finite type, finite invariant affine atlas and finite reduced proper partition fixed locus. Add a flavor torus acting trivially on X_k and its inverse character line L. The genuine global insertion is `alpha=e(TX_k tensor L)` capped with the complex-oriented `[X_k]`. Applying `thm-qftx-proper-fixed-locus-noncompact-localization` then proves `p_loc(alpha cap[X_k])=sum_fixed prod(w-mtilde)/prod(w)`. Thus the noncompact mathematical pushforward is actually supplied, not assumed as a physics pole formula. The finite two one-box terms in50/51 follow, including the empty k=0 coefficient1. Identifying this mathematical insertion with a physical saddle/hypermultiplet sector remains the source-qualified physics input. Positive-FI stability is not identified with zero-FI ASD moduli by notation.
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/canonical-normalization-repair.md:60:Reading limits: the present new Pestun source reading was bounded to the actual continuation, determinants and instanton formulas on printed pp33 and38–39 in the cached complete primary PDF/text. It was not a fresh full58-page reading. Earlier author/source-fetch claims remain historical evidence, not new reading claims. Mathematical ADHM core and localized-pushforward Definition/Statement/proofs were read completely for the applications above; no absolute-GAGA proof was supplied or inferred. The canonical component check is exact and bounded as described, not an exhaustive quantum or fermionic off-shell audit. There is no unresolved *confirmed normalization defect* in this repaired closure; independent regulator construction, physical continuum existence, quantum equivalence, Hall-to-Hilbert realization, and full GAGA/ASD questions remain only at their stated original conditional/source-qualified boundaries.
