+---
+id: ex-qftx-positive-real-monad-one-instanton
+kind: example
+title: An exact raw one-instanton block
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+page: qftx-positive-real-linear-monad-normal-forms-examples
