+Sources: Donaldson §§3–4 and 6, printed pp. 4–6 and 10–11, https://arxiv.org/pdf/2205.08639; Nakajima–Yoshioka §3.1, printed pp. 17–19, https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/0311058. Their sign context is compared; the one-instanton curvature matrix and Hodge-star calculation are local.
+
+Dependencies: main normal-form theorem, ADHM definition, rank/stability criterion, charge normalization, and curvature definition; all mathematical-premise. dependency_level 8. Decision: ready after the main theorem and direct prerequisites closed; the finite matrix and positive-orientation ASD-sign checks are complete. Final readiness record pending.

